*.mdb.meta

# --- Builds mobiles / exports ---
*.apk
*.aab
*.unitypackage
*.app
crashlytics-build.properties
sysinfo.txt

# --- Système ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini

# --- Claude Code : réglages perso (le .mcp.json du projet, lui, est versionné) ---
.claude/settings.local.json

# --- Antigravity ---
.gemini/

# --- Roadmap interne ---
ROADMAP.md

# Blender kit: generated previews and Python cache (rebuild with the scripts)
Tools/Blender/previews/
Tools/Blender/**/__pycache__/
